OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA warm and
OL,6,Fhumid evening with the chance of
OL,7,Fshowers. Isolated heavy downpours
OL,8,Fcould occur in places, with the
OL,9,Fpossibility of thunderstorms, hail and
OL,10,Fgusty winds locally. However, many
OL,11,Fplaces probably staying dry. Remaining
OL,12,Fsimilar overnight with winds
OL,13,Ffreshening later.
OL,14,
OL,15,CWednesday:FOften cloudy with
OL,16,Foccasional sunny intervals and the
OL,17,Fchance of showers, mainly in the north
OL,18,Fand west of the region. Feeling
OL,19,Fnotably cooler with a brisk westerly
OL,20,Fbreeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
